# An already-enveloped entry is re-stamped at the target, rewriting its tag.
MODULE: EnvelopedValuesVerbatimRestamped
TARGET: EnvelopedValuesVerbatim
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the versioning stage re-stamps an enveloped entry
PERTURBS: RunVersioning

--- FIND
       ELSE IF origin = "Local" \/ ~tStrictV \/ val.tag \in Upcastable
       THEN /\ Advance(val)
--- REPLACE
       ELSE IF origin = "Local" \/ ~tStrictV \/ val.tag \in Upcastable
       THEN /\ Advance(Env(val.body, "Target"))
--- END
